acious living area opens to a covered lanai through a three-panel sliding glass door, providing an inviting indoor-outdoor space to relax with family and friends. A convenient half-bath is also located on the first floor. Upstairs, you'll find all three bedrooms, including a generously sized primary suite featuring two closets-one being a walk-in closet-and an attached primary bathroom with dual sinks and a walk-in shower. Two additional spacious bedrooms share a hall bathroom, and a separate laundry room with washer and dryer hookups adds convenience to the upper level. Conveniently located near local schools and tons of shopping and dining and 2 minutes from Advent Health Hospital with quick access to State Road 27, 192 and I-4 with convenient access to all of the Parks and Central Florida attractions. Residents of the gated Atria at Ridgewood Lakes Golf community enjoy access to a playground, with optional golf course access available for an additional fee. Full Lawn care by the HOA are included in the rental rate. A small pet may be considered on a case-by case basis. Proof of a renters insurance policy is required to rent this property. Showings by Appointment Only. Must see to fully appreciate. Call today for appointment to view: Email us See more photos","age_restricted":false,"income_restricted":false,"flags":[],"min_rent":1850,"images":[{"url":"https://ap.rdcpix.com/0df7a88f22cf1d1245af0a63514f786fl-m4288659623r.jpg","title":null,"tags":["garage","house_view","road","complete","front","exterior"],"primary":true,"origins":[{"kind":"primary"},{"kind":"listing"},{"kind":"api_gallery"}],"source_urls":["https://ap.rdcpix.com/0df7a88f22cf1d1245af0a63514f786fl-m4288659623s.jpg","https://ap.rdcpix.com/0df7a88f22cf1d1245af0a63514f786fl-m4288659623r.jpg"],"resolution_source":"API size:MAX"},{"url":"https://ap.rdcpix.com/0df7a88f22cf1d1245af0a63514f786fl-m3569666444r.jpg","title":null,"tags":["kitchen"],"primary":false,"origins":[{"kind":"listing"},{"kind":"api_galler